      "writtenOn": "2022-09-27T17:41:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We need this for PTS GAP tests, for ingest_hci. The remote disconnects once the test finishes, but this could be in the middle of an LMP procedure.\n\nI\u0027ll add a proper failure command response, sure, as well as logging on the client side.",
